              "type": "text",
              "text": "Let ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "f(x)=2x+3",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "g(x)=5x+b",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", where b is a constant. Find the value of b so that ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "g(f(x))=f(g(x))",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
