    "answer": {
      "short": "$b=12$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}g(f(x))&=5(2x+3)+b\\\\g(f(x))&=10x+15+b\\\\f(g(x))&=2(5x+b)+3\\\\f(g(x))&=10x+2b+3\\end{align*}$$For equality for all $x$, the constant terms must agree:$$\\begin{align*}15+b&=2b+3\\\\b&=12\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 29
